This release preserves the application implementation and updates branding,
public documentation, source comments and synthetic test addresses.
A test-only database guard prevents accidentally selecting the application
default for destructive integration tests. The export inventory records hashes.
Color picker changes use independent debounce timers with lifecycle cleanup;
focused regression tests cover persistence operations and undo/redo behavior.
No original Git history is included.

Third-party packages are not vendored. Their licenses, copyrights and notices
remain with their owners and must be retained when distributing an installed or
bundled application. Frontend versions/public registry locations are recorded
in package-lock.json; Python requirements are in server/pyproject.toml.
